# File-backed openOODA vendor

This tree is the file-backed vendor. Static HTTPS may serve the same files at `https://registry.openooda.org`. The CLI still uses `--vendor` on disk. `index.sig` is local HMAC, not a public minisign root.

Each directory is a package name with `manifest` (key=value) and a payload `.oo` file.
`index` plus `index.sig` is the signed catalog. `yank` and `advisory` are local policy files.
The product CLI does not fetch this host yet.

Usage from `ooda/`:

    ./bin/ooda add hello --vendor ../registry
    ./bin/ooda pkg
